  "ruleText": "Ret 308.09 Petition For Relief Due To Financial Inability To Pay. Petitions for relief pursuant to Ret 308.08 shall be filed in the form of a written statement, under oath, claiming financial inability to make such payments and disclosing all income, assets, and liabilities of the eligible employee and his or her spouse, if any.\n\nSource. #5324, eff 2-5-92 (from Ret 307.04), EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #7375, INTERIM, eff 10-13-00, EXPIRES: 4-11-01; ss by #7478, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7573, eff 10-10-01, EXPIRED: 10-10-09\n\nNew. #9562, eff 10-14-09, EXPIRED: 10-14-17\n\nNew. #12511, INTERIM, eff 4-11-18, EXPIRED: 10-8-18\n\nNew. #12707, eff 1-9-19",
